{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_28","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"python - <<'PY'\np='legs.py';s=open(p).read().replace('carrier_color=15, cell=4, max_steps=60):','carrier_color=15, cell=4, max_steps=60,\\\\n                              settle_turns=0):',1)\ns=s.replace('    carriers, and commit only an alternative that completes the level.','    carriers, and commit only an alternative that completes the level.')\ns=s.replace('    delivery-and-yield alternatives rather than trusting static paths.','    delivery-and-yield alternatives rather than trusting static paths.')\ns=s.replace('    of both occupied cells, avoiding stationary pieces and arena boundaries.','    of both occupied cells, avoiding stationary pieces and arena boundaries.\\\\n    Persistent targets retain obscured destinations and measure progress by\\\\n    cargo occupancy instead of the currently visible marker colors.',1)\ns=s.replace('    avatar approaches. Walls, loose cargo, and the carrier block walking.','    avatar approaches. Walls, loose cargo, and the carrier block walking.\\\\n    Optionally wait for several unchanged carrier/cargo observations before\\\\n    approaching, preventing a moving carrier from evading the facing action.',1)\nneedle='    while len(path) + 2 <= max_steps:'\npos=s.index(needle,s.index('def clear_interfering_carrier'))\ns=s[:pos]+'''    if settle_turns:\n        previous = None\n        stable = 0\n        while len(path) + 2 < max_steps:\n            signature = tuple((p, s) for p, s in block_signatures(trial.frame(), cell).items()\n                              if carrier_color in s or s == (5, 9))\n            if not any(carrier_color in s for _, s in signature):\n                break\n            stable = stable + 1 if signature == previous else 0\n            if stable >= settle_turns:\n                break\n            previous = signature\n            step(5)\n        else:\n            raise RuntimeError('Carrier did not